Start=
A PROPHETESS IN PERIL! SAVE MIKO MITAMA!

In the Cat Army's darkest hour, a beacon of light appears! MIKO MITAMA, sent by the Cat God to fight for justice, peace... and Cat Food!

This feisty l'il oracle can usually hold her own, but this time a fearsome squad of enemies stands in her way... will YOU help her?!

Help us reach over 1400 Shares and Likes to power-up Mitama and defeat the Enemy All-Stars!<br>
Each Like/Share deals 1 damage to the bad guys!

Take out all the enemies' HP and boost Mitama's strength to topple the nastiest enemies of the Cat Army, and a special reward will appear for all players!

You can also get a chance to pick up Mitama as a new Uber Rare Cat in the newest UBERFEST, starting 1/28 (11am) and continuing until 2/1 (11am)! Don't miss out, she's only available in this UBERFEST set!

